# career_path

My self-directed DevOps/Cloud learning log — daily sessions,
logged in GRIND.md , session entry generated via Chat bot since learning with in-hand lab is done with the help of it.
ROADMAP.md shows the progress with skills covered chapters. it is per platform such as OS, Network, Docker etc
DASHBOARD.md is a progress tracker with percentage coverage to give an idea.

- GRIND.md — dated session log
- ROADMAP.md — skill checklist per platform
- DASHBOARD.md — computed progress rollup


I aspire to be an IT engineer in the field of cloud, networking and devops. I am fascinated with connecting platforms and building IT infra. 
I also like to the operations side of the infra as efficient running of website/app with careful monitoring gives me a different joy
Note that i have pivoted from a sales, marketing and operations with data decision planning as a prior experience. 
That gave me the reason to join and find my way into it. I am very certain with great focus and consistency, you will progress.
When you progress, you will reach your goals for sure
